.TH PARU-COMPLETION-UPDATE 1 "November 2026" "paru-completion-hook 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
paru-completion-update \- Updates shell completion cache for paru
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B paru-completion-update
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B paru-completion-update
queries installed system packages and available repositories to regenerate cached completion lists for the \fBparu\fR AUR helper across bash, zsh, and fish shells. It is typically invoked automatically via libalpm hooks or systemd path units upon package transaction completions.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR paru (8),
.BR pacman (8)
.SH AUTHORS
Maintained by Vikyek <https://github.com/Vikyek/paru-completion-hook>.
